 - Removed support for generating code for rustc versions < 1.51.
 ## Fixed
 - Typo in code for `--rustified-non-exhaustive-enums` (#3266)
+- Constants with builtin types (e.g. `#define`s) are no longer wrapped as `u32(0)` when the default alias style is `new_type` (regression from #3288).
 ## Security
 
